	(gr_text_box "Layer    Role                 Reference   AISLER dielectric below\n------   ------------------   ---------   ----------------------------\nF.Cu     Signal (low-speed)   In1 GND     2 x 2116 prepreg  = 230 um  (Er 4.25)\nIn1.Cu   GND plane, solid     -           core              = 300 um  (Er 4.5)\nIn2.Cu   Signal (GPIO/bus)    In1 GND     3 x 2116 prepreg  = 345 um  (Er 4.25)\nIn3.Cu   Power (split pours)  -           core              = 300 um  (Er 4.5)\nIn4.Cu   GND plane, solid     -           2 x 2116 prepreg  = 230 um  (Er 4.25)\nB.Cu     Signal (high-speed)  In4 GND     -\n\nCopper 35 um on all six layers. Total ~1.615 mm."
		(start -174.4 114.6)
		(end -3.2 202.9)
		(margins 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025 1.0025)
